WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.300
Jay

2
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.190
can i sit here

3
00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:20.820
Of course

4
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.040
This was your seat

5
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.720
wow

6
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.450
what is going on

7
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.160
Very nice

8
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.580
It seems that the transfer students have also changed into new uniforms.

9
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.530
Yeah

10
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.480
Even a person like you who has no fashion sense can see it.
It must have been changed

11
00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.710
By the way, isn't Nali going to recommend you to be the monitor?

12
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:45.580
Yeah

13
00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:49.020
We agreed that if I became the squad leader
Will make her the deputy monitor

14
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.070
Is it B?

15
00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.440
That's right

16
00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:02.200
This brand also comes with a cigarette pack.

17
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.990
Didn’t South Korea not enter?

18
00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.390
Yes, my dad brought it back when he went to France.

19
00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:08.660
By the way, have you called Nali?

20
00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:09.270
She didn't answer

21
00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.760
She has been shutting down her phone since yesterday

22
00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.020
She's not usually someone who skips classes casually, right?

23
00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.420
That's right

24
00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.540
Then why didn't she come to school?

25
00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:19.620
Are you sleeping in at home?

26
00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:20.960
how do we know

27
00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:23.540
Didn't you have lunch together yesterday?

28
00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.670
She disappeared after that

29
00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:29.219
[Caihua Girls' High School Medical Club
C-Med 2024 new member recruitment]

30
00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.980
C-Med

31
00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:57.480
But the elite gathering place of Caihua Girls' High School

32
00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.289
Do you want to join too?

33
00:01:59.289 --> 00:02:01.060
Well, I want to apply and have a look

34
00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:05.260
Also, if you want to go to medical school
Joining this kind of club will give you extra points

35
00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.480
But not everyone can enter here.

36
00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.120
The threshold is very high

37
00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:11.610
Didn't Jay tell you?

38
00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.810
I heard that third graders cannot join

39
00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.230
I've heard

40
00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:17.560
Only first-year freshmen will be recruited this year

41
00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.830
But I still want to apply and see

42
00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:23.740
You do it because the president is your friend
Do you think you can go through the back door?

43
00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.010
what

44
00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.590
But it's weird

45
00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:31.360
Na Li also said before that she wanted to join this club.

46
00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:33.060
so

47
00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.240
Think about it carefully

48
00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.770
one person missing

49
00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.690
It will also be less competitive, right?

50
00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.000
If there is only one candidate, Xiao Jing

51
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.660
Everyone, please close your eyes quickly and vote with a show of hands.

52
00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.450
It's almost midterm exams

53
00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.790
teacher

54
00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:57.540
What's wrong

55
00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.990
I also want to recommend a candidate for monitor

56
00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.060
Really?

57
00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.400
Who do you want to recommend?

58
00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.910
Yu Seqi sitting next to me

59
00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:08.500
Yu Seqi

60
00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.500
Do you want to be monitor?

61
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.170
Of course

62
00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.330
I promised Seulgi if she becomes the monitor

63
00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.240
I will help her vigorously

64
00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.950
Then there's nothing we can do

65
00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.190
Come vote, everyone, take out your notebooks

66
00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.789
Cui Jing one vote

67
00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.250
Yu Seqi one vote

68
00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.560
Invalid vote

69
00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.140
[Choi Jung: 11 votes Woo Seul Gi: 11 votes
Invalid votes: 1]

70
00:04:04.039 --> 00:04:05.210
Yu Seqi

71
00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.540
Congratulations Seulgi

72
00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.840
Congratulations

73
00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.680
Congratulations

74
00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:13.930
Congratulations

75
00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.460
Hello Zhao Yaluo

76
00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.320
Are you sure you didn't issue the wrong ticket?

77
00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:21.880
I want to see it with my own eyes

78
00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:27.940
[Yu Seqi]

79
00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.870
Hey, take out your notebook and let me take a look.

80
00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:45.480
what

81
00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.180
Where did you tear up the paper to vote?

82
00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.950
Hello Cui Jing

83
00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.400
Is there anything wrong with voting?

84
00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.920
Do you dare to ask?

85
00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.700
You also think it’s strange that you would choose the monitor, right?

86
00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.580
so

87
00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:14.930
Someone tampered

88
00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:17.950
Someone must have changed the votes.

89
00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.990
Look at these votes for you

90
00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:26.980
All ripped from the same notebook
It was written by the same person

91
00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.190
There was a black box operation in this election

92
00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.050
do you mean...

93
00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:36.840
I can't get everyone's support

94
00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.480
But there is a way to collude with everyone

95
00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.640
Do you want to do black box work for me?

96
00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.130
Of course you can't

97
00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.920
So do you think someone is secretly helping me?

98
00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.420
Cui Jing, stop making trouble

99
00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:06.400
I know it too
People don’t vote for me because they like me.

100
00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:11.730
After all, I'm just a guy from the countryside

101
00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.400
Just a bumpkin with no background

102
00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.619
Xiaojing, stop making trouble

103
00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.190
Then Seulgi will be the monitor and you will be the deputy monitor.

104
00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.550
This will also give you extra points when applying to schools.

105
00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.360
Teacher, I think Cui Jing should apologize.

106
00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.030
why should i apologize

107
00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.250
Because you refuse to accept the result

108
00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.130
And humiliated Seulgi in public
He even questioned his classmates

109
00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.730
Of course you should apologize

110
00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.170
right

111
00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.290
monitor

112
00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:51.700
Yeah

113
00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.680
I hope you can apologize to everyone

114
00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.640
Sorry, I lost my temper

115
00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:34.840
what are you doing

116
00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.660
[Jay]

117
00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:36.760
Now that you've become the squad leader, it's time for a treat.

118
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.860
[Yu Seqi]

119
00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.040
Sorry, I lost my temper

120
00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.060
[Yu Seqi]

121
00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.660
Please knock on the door before coming in

122
00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.340
Although I don’t know what tricks you are up to

123
00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.330
but get out of the way

124
00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:16.960
Mom has to work

125
00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:19.380
Please go home and take a shower first

126
00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.180
I chose the monitor today.

127
00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.000
"Yu Seqi"

128
00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:25.500
Is she the monitor of your class?

129
00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.770
Can you please stop thinking you know everything?

130
00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.090
Do you have to ask questions as carefully as if you were handling a case?

131
00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:30.920
Damn it

132
00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.370
Hello Cui Jing

133
00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:35.220
I didn't ask you to be the squad leader, did I?

134
00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.420
Who are you taking your anger out on now?

135
00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.670
Lawyer Nam Ji-yeon who was class president every year during her student days
How can you understand my mood?

136
00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.840
I'll take a shower first

137
00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.940
Get it done before I come back. Go back to your room.

138
00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.530
Damn it

139
00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:07.520
The Evaluation and Supervisory Yuan should also take some measures.

140
00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.140
OK I got it

141
00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:17.910
It seems that he will be prosecuted

142
00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.100
sorry

143
00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.770
Give some settlement money

144
00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.730
Convince family members to sign a settlement agreement

145
00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.620
Is this so difficult?

146
00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:33.480
A single mother with a child probably needs money very much, right?

147
00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.760
If you can suppress the media
In fact, delaying time is not a bad thing

148
00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:41.400
After all, you have to prove medical negligence.

149
00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.330
almost impossible

150
00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.670
Who said it was a fault

151
00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:50.840
The patient's heartbeat had stopped before arriving at the hospital
How many times do you want me to say it?

152
00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:56.150
The hospital has tried its best to rescue the patients

153
00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.500
Yes I will pay attention to my words

154
00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.310
Remember every word you say

155
00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:02.330
All represent the position of the hospital

156
00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:04.090
And this matter cannot be delayed

157
00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.570
Must negotiate a reconciliation

158
00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:07.630
Don’t just give people money

159
00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:08.930
Yes I know

160
00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.180
I will find a way to convince the family members

161
00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.030
Okay, you can go out now

162
00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:12.680
Yes

163
00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.390
By the way, Dean, there's one more thing

164
00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:15.760
There is a shortage of medicines

165
00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:16.970
Most of the medicines are self-paid

166
00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.470
The unit price is not low either…

167
00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:24.280
Don't worry about this kind of thing

168
00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:27.350
Even if there is a thief
After all, we are one of our own, right?

169
00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.100
I turned a blind eye to the mistakes my family made

170
00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.070
Just pretend you don't know

171
00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:32.940
OK

172
00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:49.620
[Dean Liu Taijun]

173
00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:30.490
So Nally's mother
I really sold the house at a low price.

174
00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:31.260
How much did it sell for

175
00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:32.760
3.7 billion won

176
00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:32.710
(Note: Approximately NT$79 million)

177
00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:34.660
Oh my god, did you sell it for 300 million won?

178
00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.620
(Note: Approximately NT$6.4 million)

179
00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.570
It seems that she is really in a hurry for money

180
00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.350
But why are they suddenly selling their house?

181
00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.380
Isn’t their daughter a senior in high school?

182
00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:43.780
The real estate agent said they were looking at houses in other areas.
Seems like planning to move away

183
00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.520
Please use it slowly

184
00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.060
I said I’d treat you to a fancy restaurant

185
00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.130
Why come to the pizza place?

186
00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.520
How come? I love the pizza in this store the most.

187
00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:03.650
Savory spicy sausage with rich sauce

188
00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.010
Great for eating with dip

189
00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.250
Have another cold Coke

190
00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:12.180
Are you because your mother is afraid of your allergies?
I won’t let you eat it, so you think it’s delicious, right?

191
00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.690
But Jai, why don’t you eat?

192
00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.110
I'm leaving soon

193
00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.340
Do you have an appointment with anyone?

194
00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.110
Could it be with Yu Seulgi?

195
00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.290
If you ask too many questions, you will lose your charm.

196
00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:34.890
Jay, couldn’t you...

197
00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.020
Are you really interested in Seulgi?

198
00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:15.360
Jay

199
00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.900
Besides paper cranes, do you also fold anything else?

200
00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.560
Anything else?

201
00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.080
What do you want me to fold?

202
00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:33.540
[Coin-operated KTV]

203
00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:42.370
♫No one ever told me that♫

204
00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:51.740
♫Would you like to come closer♫

205
00:14:53.680 --> 00:15:01.420
♫Let’s just wait like this♫

206
00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:11.660
♫Why did I meet you♫

207
00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:20.910
♫Where should I go now♫

208
00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:23.750
You also know this song

209
00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:27.840
Well, I have Lucid Fall at home
All albums by Misoni

210
00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.400
Are you his biggest fan?

211
00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.390
But your voice sings this song better

212
00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:34.310
what

213
00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.840
I said you have a nice voice

214
00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.110
very sweet

215
00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.250
Xiao Jing seems to be very disappointed

216
00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:06.100
Will your relationship get worse because of me?

217
00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.390
You don't need to care

218
00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:09.740
We're not very good to begin with, you know that, right?

219
00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.000
But you want to join the medical society
Maybe not that easy

220
00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.850
Cui Jing would probably object

221
00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:15.460
Also

222
00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:20.060
The air at night is so good

223
00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:22.170
Fortunately the rain stopped

224
00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:25.950
I thought you wouldn't come

225
00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:28.210
why

226
00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.240
I made you wait too long and you're angry

227
00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.760
No

228
00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.370
Just…

229
00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.930
It's easy for everyone to forget me

230
00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.320
So I don’t really wait for anyone.

231
00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.200
I don't like waiting for people

232
00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.170
I don’t know how others are doing

233
00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.240
But I do what I say
You must wait for me

234
00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.559
Although I might be a little late

235
00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:55.920
Seulgi

236
00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.110
Let's go back to my house together

237
00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:58.670
Now?

238
00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:00.600
Yeah, let's go back to my house together

239
00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.740
chat

240
00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.630
Sleep together and then go to school together tomorrow

241
00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.010
How is it? Not bad, right?

242
00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:08.319
How

243
00:17:08.319 --> 00:17:09.819
Are you afraid that your mother will not be allowed?

244
00:17:09.819 --> 00:17:11.040
Do you want me to call you?

245
00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:11.560
No

246
00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:15.390
She doesn't really care what time I get back.

247
00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:17.020
Then it's not bad, right?

248
00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.150
Let's go back to my house

249
00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.000
Arrived

250
00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.380
Hello

251
00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.390
Does it scare you?

252
00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.330
This is my brother Jieyin

253
00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:55.320
Hi Jieyin, how are you?

254
00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:58.110
You ran into sister Jenna's room again

255
00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.680
Say it quickly

256
00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.310
I thought you were an only child
You also have a sister

257
00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:05.100
But she's gone now

258
00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.920
Sorry, did I ask something I shouldn't have asked...

259
00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.660
Not the kind that passes away

260
00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.620
Although it is possible that she really passed away

261
00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:13.840
what

262
00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.850
Come in, this is my room

263
00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:26.910
Jay

264
00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:27.720
What's wrong

265
00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.280
It's like the bottom of the sea here

266
00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.580
I've scuba dived before when I traveled

267
00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:37.250
Others say the seabed is scary

268
00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:40.260
But I feel relaxed instead

269
00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.710
In silence…

270
00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:45.370
The bottom of the sea where you can’t even see your fingers
How to describe that feeling?

271
00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:49.010
It feels like returning to my mother's belly

272
00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:51.880
Yes, that's the feeling

273
00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:54.310
I feel like I'm the only one left in the world

274
00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.130
